{"articleNo":"71756","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=71756&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[LINC사업단] 2012-2학기 해외신기술견학 오리엔테이션 개최 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.12.11","hit":"4291","attachments":[{"name":"해외신기술견학 지원금 환급 서약서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=71756&attachNo=70750"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment--> </p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">[LINC사업단] 2012-2학기 해외신기술견학 오리엔테이션 개최 안내</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">해외신기술견학에 선발된 학생들을 대상으로 LINC사업단에서 오리엔테이션을 개최할 예정입니다. 선발된 학생은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2012. 12. 14(금) 13:00~ / 테크노관301호</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">에서 개최할 설명회에 참석하여 주시기 바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양견고딕,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">◎ 세부사항 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 참석대상 : 해외신기술견학 선발자 80명(포기자가 발생할 경우 추가선발된 후보자는 개별 통보)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 제출서류 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">여권 사본, 해외신기술견학 환급 서약서 제출</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(첨부파일작성) ⇒최대기한 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">12월 18일</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 개최일시 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012.12.14(금) 13:00~</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 실시장소 : 테크노관 301호 세미나실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 개인사유상 포기를 해야하는 학생은 2012.12.11.까지 연락주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 일정안내 및 주의사항을 안내해 드리니 반드시 참여하시기 바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">문의사항 7965</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
